  context.rs        - SpxCtx struct (pub_seed, sk_seed, state_seeded)
  address.rs        - Address manipulation (set_layer_addr, set_tree_addr, etc.)
  utils.rs          - ull_to_bytes, u32_to_bytes, bytes_to_ull
