  utilsx1.rs        - wots_treehashx1, fors_treehashx1 (Merkle tree building)
  fors.rs           - FORS sign/verify + compute_root
  merkle.rs         - merkle_sign, merkle_gen_root
  sign.rs           - High-level sign/verify/keypair logic
  randombytes.rs    - /dev/urandom reader


Key design decisions:
- All C function signatures preserved exactly via #[unsafe(no_mangle)] extern "C"
- Address arrays treated as [u32; 8] with byte-level access via pointer casts (matching C's (unsigned char *)addr pattern)
- Borrow checker conflicts resolved using Copy semantics on stack arrays or raw pointer splits where the C code aliases memory
- SHA-256 compression uses the same round-based structure as the C reference
